   "name": {
    "en": "Electron transport chain",
    "zh-Hant": "電子傳遞鏈"
   },
   "summary": {
    "en": "Electrons from NADH and succinate pass through complexes I to IV in the inner mitochondrial membrane. Complexes I, III and IV pump protons into the intermembrane space, and ATP synthase uses the returning protons to make ATP.",
    "zh-Hant": "NADH 與琥珀酸的電子經內膜上的複合體 I 至 IV 傳遞。複合體 I、III、IV 把質子泵入膜間腔，ATP 合酶利用回流的質子合成 ATP。"
   },
   "cite": ["fernandez-vizarra-2020"],
