   "nodes": [
    {
     "id": "enterocyte",
     "kind": "region",
     "x": 20,
     "y": 152,
     "w": 820,
     "h": 224,
     "tx": 205,
     "ty": 262,
     "color": "#8C97C4",
     "name": {
      "en": "Enterocyte",
      "zh-Hant": "腸細胞"
     },
     "sub": {
      "en": "",
      "zh-Hant": ""
     },
     "text": {
      "en": "The absorptive epithelial cell of the small intestine. Its apical brush border faces the lumen, and its basolateral membrane faces the lamina propria. Nutrients cross the cell and leave through the basolateral side.",
      "zh-Hant": "小腸的吸收性上皮細胞。頂端的刷狀緣面向腸腔，基底外側膜面向固有層。養分穿過細胞，由基底外側離開。"
     },
     "cite": ["drozdowski-2006"],
     "link": "cell:enterocyte"
    },
    {
     "id": "amy",
     "kind": "box",
     "x": 30,
     "y": 36,
     "w": 150,
     "h": 46,
     "color": "#A8481A",
     "name": {
      "en": "Amylase",
      "zh-Hant": "澱粉酶"
     },
     "sub": {
      "en": "starch → smaller sugars",
      "zh-Hant": "澱粉 → 較小的糖"
     },
     "text": {
      "en": "Salivary and pancreatic amylases digest starch in the lumen into smaller sugars.",
      "zh-Hant": "唾液與胰澱粉酶在腸腔內把澱粉消化成較小的糖。"
     },
     "cite": ["drozdowski-2006"]
    },
    {
     "id": "bbcarb",
     "kind": "box",
     "x": 30,
     "y": 98,
     "w": 150,
     "h": 40,
     "color": "#A8481A",
     "name": {
      "en": "Disaccharidases",
      "zh-Hant": "雙糖酶"
     },
     "sub": {
      "en": "maltase, sucrase",
      "zh-Hant": "麥芽糖酶、蔗糖酶"
     },
     "text": {
      "en": "Enzymes of the brush border membrane split disaccharides such as lactose and sucrose into monosaccharides (glucose, galactose, fructose) right at the cell surface.",
      "zh-Hant": "刷狀緣膜上的酶在細胞表面把乳糖、蔗糖等雙糖分解成單糖（葡萄糖、半乳糖、果糖）。"
     },
     "cite": ["drozdowski-2006"]
    },
    {
     "id": "sglt1",
     "kind": "box",
     "x": 30,
     "y": 158,
     "w": 80,
     "h": 36,
     "color": "#3B4F9C",
     "name": {
      "en": "SGLT1",
      "zh-Hant": "SGLT1"
     },
     "sub": {
      "en": "",
      "zh-Hant": ""
     },
     "text": {
      "en": "Sodium-glucose cotransporter in the apical membrane. It takes up glucose and galactose together with sodium, and it accounts for most dietary glucose uptake in the intestine. Mutations cause glucose/galactose malabsorption.",
      "zh-Hant": "頂端膜上的鈉-葡萄糖共轉運蛋白，與鈉一併攝入葡萄糖與半乳糖，負責腸道大部分膳食葡萄糖吸收。突變會導致葡萄糖／半乳糖吸收不良。"
     },
     "cite": ["rieg-2018", "wright-2007"]
    },
    {
     "id": "glut5",
     "kind": "box",
     "x": 120,
     "y": 158,
     "w": 70,
     "h": 36,
     "color": "#3B4F9C",
     "name": {
      "en": "GLUT5",
      "zh-Hant": "GLUT5"
     },
     "sub": {
      "en": "",
      "zh-Hant": ""
     },
     "text": {
